OL,3,AUproar in France over award-winning
OL,4,Aauthor accused of using AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French book scene is in uproar
OL,7,Fafter a Canadian-Haitian author billed
OL,8,Fas a sensation was accused of using
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) to write
OL,10,Fhis first novel.
OL,12,FThelyson Orelien, 38, has just been
OL,13,Fawarded the Prix du Roman Fnac ` the
OL,14,Ffirst of the literary season's prizes `
OL,15,Ffor C'etait ca ou mourir (It was either
OL,16,Fthat or die).
OL,18,FHe is also a finalist for the most
OL,19,Fprestigious annual French language
OL,20,Fawards, the Goncourt and the Renaudot,
OL,21,Fset to be issued soon.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
