OL,3,AUproar in France over award-winning
OL,4,Aauthor accused of using AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut on Tuesday a little-known group
OL,7,Fcalled Balance ton Claude (Denounce
OL,8,Fyour Claude, in reference to
OL,9,FAnthropic's AI assistant) claimed the
OL,10,Fbook was "almost totally" written by AI
OL,11,F- a charge the author denied.
